sentences.t:
Vos etiam, gemini, Rutulis cecidistis in agris,
Daucia, Laride Thymberque, simillima proles,
indiscreta suis gratusque parentibus error;

sentences.l:
You too, twins, fell on the Rutulian fields,
Daucian Larides and Thymber, most alike offspring,
not told apart by your own and to your parents a welcome mistake;

He slaughters Ladon and Pheres and Demodocus;
from Strymonius the right hand with flashing he tears sword,
raised against his throat; with a stone he strikes the face of Thoas,
and the bones scattered, mingled with brain bloody.
